  ('51c5efe3-7934-413f-b297-0615ff3cb8d0', '27611b22-0a90-449f-9b13-521ff0d6b7b4', NULL, 'article', '"Research Is More Than a Paper"
We spend years doing research, but the conversations around that research often happen in scattered places. BooffIn is built around a simple idea: research becomes more meaningful when it finds the right people.

<!--ARTICLE_DATA:{"title":"BooffIn — Where Research Finds Its People","subheading":"S.S. Ahmad, S.S. Mishra, S. Yadav","authors":["Sagar Yadav"],"abstract":"\"Research Is More Than a Paper\"\nWe spend years doing research, but the conversations around that research often happen in scattered places. BooffIn is built around a simple idea: research becomes more meaningful when it finds the right people.","sections":[{"id":"sec_1","heading":"A paper is only the beginning.","content":"You finish your experiment.\nYou analyze the results.\nYou write the paper.\nYou publish it.\nAnd then… what?\nSomeone somewhere might read it. Maybe they''ll cite it. Maybe you''ll never know who found your work interesting, who disagreed with it, or who had an idea that could take it somewhere completely new.\nBut research has never been just about papers.\nIt has always been about people talking to people.","images":[{"id":"img_1790831543066","uri":"https://lvstuqhrmagzqkgwlisl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/profile-media/27611b22-0a90-449f-9b13-521ff0d6b7b4/posts/post_1790831538184_phs0yt.png","caption":"","figureNumber":1}]},{"id":"sec_1790832381929","heading":"What if researchers had their own social space?","content":"Imagine opening an app and finding people who are working on the questions you care about.\nA student sharing an interesting observation from their first experiment.\nA PhD scholar asking for perspectives on a difficult research problem.\nA scientist discussing a recent paper.\nA professor sharing an idea that hasn''t become a publication yet.\nA researcher discovering someone working on a completely different problem—but with a technique that could solve theirs.\nThat''s the kind of environment we''re building with BooffIn.","images":[]},{"id":"sec_1790832529162","heading":"Not another place to publish papers","content":"BooffIn isn''t trying to replace journals, conferences, or research repositories.\nYour papers can stay where they already belong.\nInstead, BooffIn focuses on everything that happens around the research.\nShare an idea.\nAsk a question.\nStart a discussion.\nFind someone with similar interests.\nExchange perspectives.\nDiscover potential collaborators.\nSometimes, a short conversation can be the beginning of something much bigger.","images":[]},{"id":"sec_1790832546049","heading":"Research is social","content":"Science can sometimes look like a very individual process.\nOne researcher.\nOne laboratory.\nOne project.\nOne paper.\nBut behind almost every meaningful discovery is a network of people—collaborators, mentors, critics, colleagues, students, and researchers who challenged an idea or offered a different perspective.\nBooffIn is built around that human side of research.\nBecause sometimes what you need isn''t another search result.\nYou need another researcher.","images":[]},{"id":"sec_1790832599370","heading":"Who is BooffIn for?","content":"BooffIn is for anyone who is part of the research ecosystem:\n1. Undergraduate researchers\n2. Master''s students\n3. PhD scholars\n4. Research assistants\n5. Postdocs\n6. Professors\n7. Scientists\n8. Industry researchers\nAnd anyone genuinely curious about research\nYou don''t have to be an established scientist to have something valuable to say.\nA good question from a student can start a great discussion.","images":[]},{"id":"sec_1790832650644","heading":"Find the people behind the research","content":"The internet has made it incredibly easy to find papers.\nBut finding the people behind those papers can still be surprisingly difficult.\nBooffIn is our attempt to change that.\nA place where your research interests aren''t just keywords on a profile—they can become the starting point for conversations and connections.\nBecause research doesn''t happen in isolation.\nResearch finds its people.\nAnd that''s what BooffIn is here to help make happen.","images":[]}],"references":[],"readingTimeMinutes":3,"isDraft":false}-->', 'public', '{}', 3, 0, 3, 2, '2026-10-01T05:32:18.16861+00:00', '2026-10-01T05:32:18.16861+00:00'),
